    "title": "Tickets to Justin Bieber at Coachella: Saturday prices, stage times and more for 2026 festival | Sporting News",
    "text": "If you purchase a product or register for an account through one of the links on our site, we may receive compensation. Learn more > Something is going on in the desert, because everyone is coming down with a case of the Bieber Fever.Justin Bieber is back, taking on Coachella as Saturday's headliner. While the singer has performed a handful of times over the years, mainly at festivals, he hasn't toured since 2022. BUY NOW: Get tickets to Coachella 2026 on StubHubWhile many wondered if it would be the start of something new, it looks like Bieber is embracing his old era before embarking on Swag. During Weekend 1 of Coachella, Bieber sat down with his fans, a computer and sang his early hits in an intimate and nostalgic set.What does he have in store next? You only have \"One Time\" to see Bieber live at Coachella. Here's how you can do that with tickets to his Saturday performances in the valley.Tickets to Justin Bieber at CoachellaTickets: StubHubTickets to every day of Coachella are available now on StubHub!Justin Bieber will perform on both Saturdays of the festival. Those that want to see him live can purchase three-day passes or single-day passes to the festival.Currently, Weekend 2 costs $3,000 for a Saturday-only pass and $2,200 for a three-day ticket. Click below for an updated look at availability. Justin Bieber at Coachella date, set timeJustin Bieber will perform at Saturday on Friday, April 11 and Saturday, April 18.On Weekend 1, he will perform at 11:25 p.m. PT on Coachella Stage.Coachella 2026 lineupThe Coachella 2026 lineup is here. Below is a look at who will be performing throughout the two-weekend festival, which will be headlined by Sabrina Carpenter, Justin Bieber, Karol G and Anyma.Friday, April 10 & 17Sabrina Carpenterthe XXNine Inch NoizeDisclosureTurnstileEthel CainDijonTeddy SwimsKATSEYEDevoSexyy RedCentral CeeFoster the PeopleLevityBlood OrangeMobyMarlon HoffstadtLykke LifakeminkGordoCreepy NutsJoyce ManorBINIKettamaGroove Armad